  "en": "Estimated annual agricultural freshwater withdrawals: agricultural share of withdrawals multiplied by same-year total freshwater withdrawals and converted from billion m³ to m³. A subset of the existing total withdrawals metric. Missing observations are not imputed; countries without usable data remain unavailable. Categories and subsets can overlap, so metrics must not be added together.",
